// TEST: Anonymous plain slot beside a compact slot is checked (aborts)
// ============================================================================
// Gap G192 (1), Codex design review: a read that mixes a structured slot (a
// compact group read by its flat coordinates) with a plain one used to skip
// the whole read. The plain slot is judged on its own -- proven or checked
// against its static extent -- while the compact coordinates keep their own
// discipline. Position 5 of the leading Idx<2> stops with BL8006 in every
// lane (the sparse-key twin is pinned in emission by instance-guards).
